= Introduction =

Tiny Tool converts **plain** files into //fancy// ones. It
is written in ``Python`` and needs no other software.

== Installing ==

+ Download the archive from [the web site https://example.org/tinytool].
+ Unpack it anywhere.
+ Run ``tinytool --help``.


== Options ==

|| Option | Meaning |
| -o FILE | write the result to FILE |
| -q | quiet, no messages |
| -v | print the version |

```
$ tinytool -o out.html notes.txt
converted 12 lines
```

% this comment is not shown in the output
- __Note__: options may be combined.
- --Deprecated--: the old ``-x`` switch.
